<title>HONG KONG: Wing Hang sets HK$200 mln 2-tranche FRCD.</title>
<headline>Wing Hang sets HK$200 mln 2-tranche FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate certificate of deposit issue has been privately placed, arranger HSBC Markets said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER  WING HANG BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$200 MLN IN TWO TRANCHES.</p>
<p>	     TRANCHE (A):  HK$100 MLN</p>
<p>	     TRANCHE (B):  HK$100 MLN</p>
<p> COUPON    (A) 3MH+15BP, (B)  3MH+25BP</p>
<p>MATURITY  (A) 6 MTHS (DUE 16.JUN.97), (B) 1 YR (DUE 16.DEC.97)</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	ISS PRICE  UNDISCLOSED  LAUNCHED  13.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	CALLS	NONE</p>
<p> LISTING   --	  REPAYMENT  BULLET	 DENOMS    HK$500K</p>
<p> RATING    Baa1	SALE LMTS  --	     TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   --	  CRS DEF    --	     FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY HONG KONG GOV LAW    --	     PAY DATE  16.DEC.96</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES   NOT DISCLOSE</p>
<p> ARRANGER   HSBC MARKETS</p>
<p> NOTES	CLEARING THROUGH HK CMU.</p>
<p>		FIRST ISSUED OFF CD PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852)2843 6960</p>
</text>
